## Anti-Patterns to Avoid

### ❌ Incomplete Analysis
**Problem**: Missing categories or superficial analysis
**Solution**: Follow 8-category framework completely

### ❌ Unattributed Claims
**Problem**: Facts without source attribution
**Solution**: Every claim MUST have source

### ❌ Stale Data
**Problem**: Using outdated information
**Solution**: Enforce data freshness rules

### ❌ Non-Interactive Dashboards
**Problem**: Static, non-interactive visualizations
**Solution**: Implement interactive charts and filters

### ❌ Inconsistent Formatting
**Problem**: Inconsistent report structures
**Solution**: Use standardized templates

